OL,3,ABrandon Flowers: Is fame worth it? I'm
OL,4,Anot sure anymore
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrandon Flowers has a confession.
OL,8,FFor the last 25 years, he's been the
OL,9,Ffrontman of The Killers, channelling
OL,10,Fhis love of stadium rock and British
OL,11,Fnew wave on songs like Mr Brightside,
OL,12,FWhen You Were Young and Human.
OL,14,FBut in the back of his mind, there's
OL,15,Falways been an alternative soundtrack.
OL,17,F"You know, a lot of guys in my line of
OL,18,Fbusiness develop drug addictions," he
OL,19,Fsays.
